    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323">

                <pb facs="0464" n="442" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg442"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/1–2352: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d323-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1952-01-23T19:21:00-05:00">January 23,
                            1952—7:21 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Gadel 812. For Gross from Hickerson. Re
                    Membership: Appreciate your Delga 1148
                    explaining developments Ital membership case. You may be sure your action
                    completely in accord with instructions pursuant Gadel 755 and we continue maintain policy set forth therein. Dept rptd Gadel
                    755 to Rome Jan 18 so Emb wld be completely
                    informed our position. [Hickerson.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d323-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d323-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated for information to Rome as 3347.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
